  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Orientation Visit - EMERGENCY RESPONSE (RTM), through Koeppen, Elliot &amp; Associates, Ltd.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This $213,484 Reverse Trade Mission brings representatives of the Ministry of Home Affairs and the National Disaster Management Authority and state and municipal officials to the U.S. to meet with U.S. companies active in the emergency management sector and U.S. governmental agencies at several levels. The Indian authorities currently are developing Emergency Operation Centers (EOCs) and developing a range of improved emergency management capabilities and related infrastructure, presenting opportunities for U.S. firms in this sector.</narrative>
  </description>
